author_final_remarks.value:
As the author-reviewer discussion period concludes, we would like extend our sincere gratitude to all reviewers, ACs and SACs for their constructive feedback, active engagement in discussion, and appreciation of our work and response.

We are delighted to see that the reviewers recognize our work as:

- novel, well-justified and highly significant **(Reviewers jUPA, 4sg1)**;

- well-presented, well-documented and easy to follow **(Reviewers 4sg1, gzGj)**;

- contains extensive, rigorous and insightful empirical findings **(Reviewers jUPA, 4PtQ, gzGj)**;

- with good dataset code accessibility **(Reviewers jUPA, 4sg1, gzGj)**;

- is constructive for continued development **(Reviewer 4sg1)**;

- and satisfies a broader set of characteristics compared to prior work **(Reviewer gzGj)**.

During the discussion, several questions about our paper were raised, including the dataset quality (justification of metrics by **Reviewer 4PtQ**, diversity, statistics and qualitative analysis by **Reviewers 4PtQ and 4sg1**, source of data by **Reviewers jUPA, gzGj)**, reproducibility with its long-context nature **(Reviewer gzGj),** clarity and contribution on comparison to prior works **(Reviewers jUPA, 4sg1),** potential downstream tasks **(Reviewer 4PtQ),** and further explanation on model saturation **(Reviewers jUPA, 4sg1).**

We have addressed these issues meticulously by providing statistics and case study, as well as clarification on topics including publicly available long-context LLMs, data source, comparison to prior work and model saturation issues. We are very pleased that all reviewers responded unanimously agree that all concerns have been resolved as no further concern is mentioned in reviewers' replies. 

In summary, our benchmark is the **first many-shot reasoning benchmark that is large-scale, has diverse input-output modalities and is not a straightforward compilation of existing datasets**. We provide an **extensive, insightful and rigorous empirical study** that sheds light on the importance of many-shot in-context learning and provides many important insights, with an **available automatic pipeline that is constructive for future research in this area**.

Finally, we would like to thank all reviewers, ACs and SACs again for their efforts in strengthening our paper. We will integrate all the advice in the revision and are confident that it will be an important contribution to the community.

